OL,3,GNEWSAFoodbank to close after 16 years
OL,4,Aamid rising costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA foodbank serving an East Yorkshire
OL,7,Ftown has closed after 16 years due to
OL,8,Frising costs and a drop in donations.
OL,10,FThe Mission Trinity Foodbank, which
OL,11,Fsupports people in Goole and the
OL,12,Fsurrounding villages, began as part of
OL,13,Fthe local Methodist church's mission to
OL,14,Fhelp homeless people and those facing
OL,15,Ffinancial hardship.
OL,17,FFounder David Sample said: "Over time
OL,18,Four funds have declined and declined,
OL,19,Fto the point where we can't really
OL,20,Fafford to keep going much longer, and
OL,21,Falso because of this cost of living
OL,22,Fcrisis that's going on at the moment."
